    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Church Place is a well-appointed property that has been cleverly split into two, self-contained apartments - a two-bedroom on the ground floor and a one-bedroom on the first floor. The property also benefits from a patio space to the rear and balcony on the first floor. \n\nThe entrance hall provides access to both units. The ground floor apartment briefly comprises; entrance hall, living room, two spacious double bedroom, kitchen area, and a bathroom in the hall. There is direct access to the rear patio. \n\nThe upper apartment is also accessed from the main entrance hall. Upstairs there is a warm and welcoming landing that provides access to a double bedroom, study, living space, kitchenette, and main bathroom. There is also direct access to balcony from the bedroom. \n\nEast Wall is a mature and well-established area enjoying café's, bars, pharmacies, supermarkets Aldi & Lidl, Dublin Port Tunnel and Fairview Park very nearby and is also within walking distance of the City Centre & IFSC. The 3 Arena, Docklands Dart Station and Luas Red Line are all within walking distance away also. This attractive home is sure to be of immense interest to both first time buyers and investors alike due to its superbly convenient location and its excellent potential to create a wonderful family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.041m x 2.986m\nWarm and welcoming entrance hall.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.473m x 5.479m\nBright and spacious living/dining room with access to the kitchen open to the rear.\n\nKitchen - \nWell appointed kitchen off the living and dining room, fitted with oven/4-ring hob and ample storage in the floor and wall mounted cupboards.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.384m x 4.718m\nSpacious double bedroom to the rear of the property with laminate wood floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.167m x 1.791\nSecond double bedroom with laminate wood flooring floor to ceiling windows also provides access to the private patio\n\nBedroom 3 - 1.897m x 3.267m\nThrid bedroom has laminate wooden flooring and benefits from an en-suite.\n\nStudy - 2.274m x 3.267m\nSpacious study has laminate flooring and benefits from access to the spacious balcony.\n\nKitchenette - 2.017m x 2.670m\nLocated on the first floor fitted with mounted wall mounted storage, fridge/freezer and is plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.283m x 2.111m\nLocated of bedroom 4, tiled bathroom fitted with wc, whb and shower.\n\nBathroom - 2.413m x 1.174m\nTiled bathroom featuring wc, whb and shower.\n\nPatio - 5.176m x 2.053m\nSpacious patio to the rear of the property.\n\n"
      },
